            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Limited Time Offer</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/e8856d7219089df0096ab6c091cf8c38.avif?t=1775120208\" width=616 height=392 /></span><br>The LEFT ALIVE Day One Edition will be available for a limited time only and includes the following bonus content:<br><br>• A digital soundtrack sampler featuring music tracks from the game<br><br>• A set of x5 stunning wallpapers including designs from legendary Yoji Shinkawa from KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS (Sizes: 1024 x 768, 1280 x 1024, 1920 x 1080, 2560 x 1600)<br><br>• The Destructive DLC Pack: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ammo Pack<br></li><li>Light Body Armor <br></li><li> Recovery Pack<br></li><li>US-13-7 Padub (SP) Weapon</li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.poster.avif?t=1775120208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.webm?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.mp4?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Veteran developers, Toshifumi Nabeshima (director, Armored Core series), Yoji Shinkawa from KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS (character designer, METAL GEAR SOLID series), and Takayuki Yanase (mech designer, Ghost in the Shell: Arise, Mobile Suit Gundam 00, Xenoblade Chronicles X) join forces to create LEFT ALIVE’s dark and gritty world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEFT ALIVE tells a human story of survival from the perspective of three different protagonists during the devastating invasion set in war-torn Novo Slava in 2127.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the massive power gap between man and machine in pulse-pounding encounters: face off against powerfully armed troops, armored vehicles and towering mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your playing style: engage in frenetic gun battles or dispatch your enemies with stealth and wit. Set traps, collect and craft consumables to survive while exploring a devastated city ravaged by the atrocities of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the full story behind the war through the eyes of three different characters: as you progress through the game, experience multiple story paths each requiring bold decisions with desperate consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.poster.avif?t=1775120208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.webm?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.mp4?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.poster.avif?t=1775120208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.webm?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/31aa6bd38378ac25a1a24130a1db39d9.mp4?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Veteran developers, Toshifumi Nabeshima (director, Armored Core series), Yoji Shinkawa from KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS (character designer, METAL GEAR SOLID series), and Takayuki Yanase (mech designer, Ghost in the Shell: Arise, Mobile Suit Gundam 00, Xenoblade Chronicles X) join forces to create LEFT ALIVE’s dark and gritty world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEFT ALIVE tells a human story of survival from the perspective of three different protagonists during the devastating invasion set in war-torn Novo Slava in 2127.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the massive power gap between man and machine in pulse-pounding encounters: face off against powerfully armed troops, armored vehicles and towering mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your playing style: engage in frenetic gun battles or dispatch your enemies with stealth and wit. Set traps, collect and craft consumables to survive while exploring a devastated city ravaged by the atrocities of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the full story behind the war through the eyes of three different characters: as you progress through the game, experience multiple story paths each requiring bold decisions with desperate consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.poster.avif?t=1775120208\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.webm?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714370/extras/84253f7384fe3e3f8f876d1fe5c7b0f2.mp4?t=1775120208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "short_description": "LEFT ALIVE™ is a brand-new survival action shooter telling a human story of survival from the perspective of three different protagonists during the devastating invasion set in war-torn Novo Slava in 2127.",
